  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For minimum value $|\\vec{r}+b \\vec{s}|=0$. Let $\\vec{r}$ and $\\vec{s}$ are anti-parallel so $b \\vec{s}=-\\vec{r}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore|b \\vec{s}|^{2}+|\\vec{r}+b \\vec{s}|^{2}=|-\\vec{r}|^{2}+|\\vec{r}-\\vec{r}|^{2}=|\\vec{r}|^{2}$",
